refactor: reorganize tests by domain and clean up dead tooling

Project hygiene plus the fixes from the backend/frontend audits. Verified with
`tsc --noEmit`, the full suite (219 tests, 212 pass, 7 skipped) and a clean build
before pushing.

Project layout
- tests/ split into agent/, storage/ and platform/ by what each file exercises;
  tests/README.md documents the map and the conventions for adding cases
- the six in-package iLink test files collapse into tests/platform/ilink.test.ts
  (72 cases, identical count), now importing through the public @atri/ilink
  entry so the tests also prove those helpers are exported
- scripts/ops/ collects the one-off SSH and GitHub push tools that nothing
  referenced, with a README explaining why they are kept out of the way
- scripts/check-api-pairs.mjs reads UI calls out of app.js instead of a
  hand-maintained list that had drifted into reporting live routes as dead

Performance and correctness
- config.prompt() read the prompt file from disk on every turn: readFileSync was
  the argument to getSetting, so it ran even when the DB held an override. Now
  cached per prompt name
- db.sources() was 1 + N statements; replaced with a single JOIN over
  messages/memories/diary_sections
- db.forget() was O(n^2) because load() sat inside the fixed-point loop
- message assembly re-read every media-bearing row even when images() had not
  rewritten it
- removed plan.recent.shift() in the token-shedding loop: nothing read the list
  afterwards
- dropped the whole-table GROUP BY behind /api/status, which ran on every 2.5s
  poll and was never rendered
- BudgetError recovery now discards only assistant messages; it used to splice
  out the user's own message and retry with a bare format instruction

UI
- .btn.danger no longer erases .btn.ghost's background and border (equal
  specificity, later declaration)
- --accent-btn-2 darkened to clear 4.5:1, and hover darkens instead of
  brightening into 3.86:1
- new --danger-ink for error text; --danger stays for borders and icons
- selected nav/subtab/peer states gained an inset edge so they no longer rely on
  colour alone
- sticker 停用 is reversible again: the destructive path moved to its own
  DELETE /api/stickers/:slug/file route with a confirm step, and only custom
  uploads expose it
- failed tasks gained a 忽略 action (POST /api/tasks/:id/dismiss)
- toast clears the mobile nav, icon buttons meet 44px, the composer focus ring
  is visible again, aria-live moved off the container that every poll rebuilds
- settings reports save state at the button and warns before discarding edits

Tooling
- prettier had a config but no script; added format and format:check
- package.json gained check:api
